---
// src/pages/privacy-policy.astro — Privacy Policy page
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base title="Privacy Policy | Startup Yeti" description="Privacy Policy for Startup Yeti. Learn how we collect, use, and protect your personal information." path="/privacy-policy">
  <section class="hero-tint border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800">
    <div class="wrap-narrow pb-10 pt-12 md:pb-14 md:pt-16">
      <h1 class="display text-4xl md:text-5xl">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="meta mt-4">Last updated: November 18, 2022</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="wrap-narrow py-12">
    <article class="prose prose-lg dark:prose-invert">
      <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
      <h3>Personal Information</h3>
      <p>We collect email addresses that you provide voluntarily when you interact with our website and services. This includes when you sign up for our newsletter, contact us, or use our platform.</p>
      <h3>Automatically Collected Information</h3>
      <p>Some information is collected automatically when you access our services, including:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Internet Protocol (IP) addresses</li>
        <li>Browser characteristics and type</li>
        <li>Device characteristics</li>
        <li>Operating system details</li>
        <li>Location data based on device settings</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>How We Use Your Information</h2>
      <p>We process your information for the following purposes:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Responding to user inquiries and providing customer support</li>
        <li>Sending administrative communications and updates</li>
        <li>Requesting feedback and improving our services</li>
        <li>Protecting vital interests and ensuring safety</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Our legal bases for processing include consent, contractual necessity, legitimate business interests, legal compliance, and vital interest protection.</p>
      <h2>Information Sharing</h2>
      <p>We do not sell your personal information to third parties. Startup Yeti has not disclosed or sold any personal information to third parties for a business or commercial purpose in the preceding twelve (12) months.</p>
      <p>We may share or transfer your information in connection with, or during negotiations of, any merger, sale of company assets, financing, or acquisition of all or a portion of our business to another company.</p>
      <h2>Data Retention and Security</h2>
      <p>We retain your data only as long as necessary for the purposes stated in this privacy policy. While we implement technical and organizational safeguards to protect your personal information, no electronic transmission over the internet or information storage technology can be guaranteed to be 100% secure.</p>
      <h2>Your Rights</h2>
      <h3>For EU, UK, and Canadian Residents</h3>
      <p>You have the right to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Request access to your personal data</li>
        <li>Request correction of inaccurate data</li>
        <li>Request deletion of your data</li>
        <li>Request restriction of processing</li>
        <li>Withdraw consent at any time</li>
        <li>Opt out of marketing communications</li>
      </ul>
      <h3>For California Residents</h3>
      <p>Under the California Consumer Privacy Act (CCPA), you have the right to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Know what personal data is being collected</li>
        <li>Know whether your personal data is sold or disclosed and to whom</li>
        <li>Request deletion of your personal data</li>
        <li>Opt out of the sale of your personal data</li>
        <li>Not be discriminated against for exercising your privacy rights</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>Cookies and Tracking Technologies</h2>
      <p>Our website uses cookies and similar tracking technologies to enhance user experience and analyze website traffic. You can adjust your browser settings to refuse cookies, though this may limit some functionality of our services.</p>
      <h2>Contact Information</h2>
      <p>If you have questions or comments about this privacy policy, or if you would like to exercise your data subject rights, please contact us:</p>
      <p><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:contact@startupyeti.com">contact@startupyeti.com</a></p>
      <p><strong>Mailing Address:</strong><br />Startup Yeti<br />29 November 97<br />Tetovo, MK 1220<br />Macedonia</p>
    </article>
  </section>
</Base>
